{
 "slug": "choco-alternative",
 "pageId": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
 "text_batches": [
  [
   {
    "label": "t0",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "c3df870f-ba8c-9aaf-796c-bb1249eeefa3"
     },
     "text": "20-30 Min"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t1",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "3f7a12ca-f338-fa01-17fc-97d91ca5fe9d"
     },
     "text": "Saved on each order that moves off the phone"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t2",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "3027ca32-6180-79a6-1a66-d9f911e27a08"
     },
     "text": "24-48 Hrs"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t3",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "3f7a12ca-f338-fa01-17fc-97d91ca5fea2"
     },
     "text": "Is how long setup runs for most"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t4",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "448bf1fe-361f-3c13-6268-4572092953ba"
     },
     "text": "24/7"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t5",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "3f7a12ca-f338-fa01-17fc-97d91ca5feac"
     },
     "text": "Covers the hours your desk does not"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t6",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "1cd5e3b3-4adf-89d2-b8a1-ba35fe69754d"
     },
     "text": "Why Teams Compare"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t7",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "964de5d5-3961-b811-98b9-cfb069a7e8be"
     },
     "text": "Why teams look for an alternative to Choco"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t8",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "964de5d5-3961-b811-98b9-cfb069a7e8c2"
     },
     "text": "Choco calls itself an AI platform for food and beverage wholesalers. It digitizes inbound orders, runs an online catalog that recommends items, and carries a sales hub and a foodservice CRM. None of that is a flaw. The gap that starts a Choco alternative search is usually one step wide, and replacing a whole platform to close it is out of proportion."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t9",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "eb7fd825-30c6-7275-9a2f-c98f68eb960f"
     },
     "text": "Some kitchens never take to tapping through an app"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t10",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "964de5d5-3961-b811-98b9-cfb069a7e8cc"
     },
     "text": "Every ordering platform has some accounts that keep calling, texting or leaving a voicemail at 10pm. They like the person on the other end more than a screen of buttons, and those are the orders that still eat your morning."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t11",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "bacfcf90-d337-55e1-9a02-49b2f6962e16"
     },
     "text": "A parsed message still gets read by you"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t12",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "964de5d5-3961-b811-98b9-cfb069a7e8d3"
     },
     "text": "Choco's OrderAgent lifts an order out of a voicemail, a text, even a snapshot of a handwritten pad, which is a genuinely clever bit of engineering. But the cook who left that note never saw the lines your desk ended up with."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t13",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "83921d0d-4ec1-911e-4420-fee5bfd13614"
     },
     "text": "You want one step fixed, not a new stack"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t14",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "964de5d5-3961-b811-98b9-cfb069a7e8da"
     },
     "text": "Swapping Choco out would mean rebuilding the storefront, the sales routine and the customer records your reps lean on. That is a lot of change to buy when the trouble is the telephone."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t15",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "f5b08e4d-7503-2dae-cdd2-6f455d9fe83d"
     },
     "text": "The Choco alternative that leaves Choco in place"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t16",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "f49b7c29-2a8e-b047-d714-742b52e0a34c"
     },
     "text": "What You Get"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t17",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "d4031fde-2fc3-b283-bb1c-784e741d725b"
     },
     "text": "Voice Ordering"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t18",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "24599529-959c-8515-3ff2-44ca6d68a0ed"
     },
     "text": "Built by whoever is standing in the cooler"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t19",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "24599529-959c-8515-3ff2-44ca6d68a0f1"
     },
     "text": "Your account opens the app, presses to speak, and says what the kitchen is short of. Every item appears as a line with a quantity against it. They review it, change what needs changing, and only then does it leave."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t20",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "129bd613-9d92-1e3c-fcbe-e5fdebfe4133"
     },
     "text": "Nothing is sent until your customer has looked at the list"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t21",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "129bd613-9d92-1e3c-fcbe-e5fdebfe4139"
     },
     "text": "Works from the cooler or the prep bench, at any hour"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t22",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "129bd613-9d92-1e3c-fcbe-e5fdebfe413f"
     },
     "text": "20 to 30 minutes back against the same order by phone"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t23",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "129bd613-9d92-1e3c-fcbe-e5fdebfe4145"
     },
     "text": "Reps stop writing up reorders from accounts on the app, so that time goes into selling"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t24",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "d5d6538b-4114-51aa-7fff-aad875b7bfe3"
     },
     "text": "Order Guides"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t25",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdea2"
     },
     "text": "One item list per account, built from yours"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t26",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdea6"
     },
     "text": "Pass us the guides you keep per customer. We load them against your SKUs at the price you hold for that account, so a spoken item lands on the right row against your own SKU."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t27",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdead"
     },
     "text": "A kitchen only ever sees what it actually buys"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t28",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdeb3"
     },
     "text": "The catalog and the pricing stay yours to set"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t29",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdeb9"
     },
     "text": "Edit a list once and it holds on the orders after"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t30",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdebf"
     },
     "text": "No browsing and no cart to abandon"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t31",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "6555f9fc-4dcc-b940-f384-6001ce4db69f"
     },
     "text": "Delivery Formats"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t32",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb118"
     },
     "text": "It arrives however your office likes it"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t33",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb11c"
     },
     "text": "Nobody has to move desks for this. A finished order goes out as an email with a PDF, Excel or Word file attached, or straight into your ERP over the API, over EDI, or into QuickBooks."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t34",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb123"
     },
     "text": "Addressed to a rep, or to the purchasing desk"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t35",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb129"
     },
     "text": "On a direct feed there is no rekeying at your end"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t36",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb12f"
     },
     "text": "Picking, billing and delivery carry on unchanged"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t37",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb135"
     },
     "text": "No part of your stack has to be retired first"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t38",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "099f67ce-06ef-dc92-c6e6-fdc4481f359f"
     },
     "text": "Inventory Visibility"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t39",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df93a"
     },
     "text": "Stock you can see while the orders arrive"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t40",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df93e"
     },
     "text": "VoiceOrder Solutions shows real-time inventory visibility tied to what is being ordered, and the catalog updates as stock levels change. It is not the system of record for stock: yours stays in charge, and a demo shows how the levels connect."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t41",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df945"
     },
     "text": "Every line you carry, not only the quick movers"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t42",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df94b"
     },
     "text": "Fewer stockout surprises on a late, heavy order"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t43",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df951"
     },
     "text": "Numbers come out of whatever you count with now"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t44",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df957"
     },
     "text": "We never count or buy stock for you"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t45",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "021e8cc1-41f6-a5cc-3995-2a8c101d005c"
     },
     "text": "Not Either Or"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t46",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "b1f1a02d-1126-5fc3-d0e9-a08845da64e7"
     },
     "text": "How Choco and VoiceOrder Solutions split the work"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t47",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "b1f1a02d-1126-5fc3-d0e9-a08845da64ec"
     },
     "text": "We are not a Choco replacement, and we would rather you did not treat us as one. Our app adds on, so a storefront that is already in place has nothing to undo before you try it."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t48",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "b1f1a02d-1126-5fc3-d0e9-a08845da6507"
     },
     "text": "Let the catalog sell, and let voice take the order"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t49",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "b1f1a02d-1126-5fc3-d0e9-a08845da650a"
     },
     "text": "A storefront that suggests items earns its keep on a buyer who is browsing with time to spare. The reorder at the end of a shift is not that moment. The two jobs can sit together without arguing."
    }
   }
  ],
  [
   {
    "label": "t50",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "5368ca22-de87-9362-819f-9733489b5a6d"
     },
     "text": "Give each account the way in it prefers"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t51",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "5368ca22-de87-9362-819f-9733489b5a70"
     },
     "text": "Kitchens that are happy tapping through Choco's app can stay there. Offer the voice app to the ones who still call or text, which is where speaking the order helps most."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t52",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "ce9a8dd2-5aea-6c74-fe2d-a05cf2535624"
     },
     "text": "Orders land where they already land"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t53",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "ce9a8dd2-5aea-6c74-fe2d-a05cf2535627"
     },
     "text": "Whatever you add, the order still arrives into the system you chose, by EDI, API or QuickBooks, or by email to your desk. Nobody has to learn a new screen to receive it."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t54",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "4590e4b1-e797-fe36-9056-58de9ded19b4"
     },
     "text": "See where voice ordering fits beside Choco"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t55",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "4590e4b1-e797-fe36-9056-58de9ded19b8"
     },
     "text": "Twenty minutes. One spoken order, end to end, and the time it gives back on the next one."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t56",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "6923bf1d-5310-eba9-bcb8-7266c5f85e97"
     },
     "text": "Getting Started"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t57",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5ec7"
     },
     "text": "Short enough to finish this week"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t58",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "38293a1d-fb4c-9501-8014-28855f9128b6"
     },
     "text": "There is no data project at the front of this, and nothing inside Choco changes. You send item lists, we set the customers up, and your customers begin sending orders."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t59",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5ed6"
     },
     "text": "Hand us the item lists"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t60",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5eda"
     },
     "text": "A spreadsheet is fine. Each account's items and your prices go into a single admin screen, lined up with your SKUs."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t61",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5ede"
     },
     "text": "Your accounts get opened"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t62",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5ee3"
     },
     "text": "We set up each account, and the customer downloads the app. Most have sent something in by the end of the day."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t63",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5f00"
     },
     "text": "It lands finished"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t64",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5f04"
     },
     "text": "Approved by the customer, carrying a number and a time, in the shape your system expects."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t65",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a176"
     },
     "text": "Choco plus VoiceOrder Solutions."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t66",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "0c6cf9c7-bbe3-a64d-76b9-1539a90ac7c8"
     },
     "text": "Nothing to switch off."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t67",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "7b8acd63-aca8-b070-4eb6-f64ce47abebc"
     },
     "text": "Add, Don't Swap"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t68",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a179"
     },
     "text": "Adding voice ordering should take nothing away, and the table is drawn that way. Most searches for a Choco alternative start with one gap, not a broken platform, so below is Choco today, then Choco with our app beside it. The two do not connect, and everything said about Choco comes from their own site."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t69",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "1ff87819-9b94-6168-dfbb-e81fd6a5b236"
     },
     "text": "Feature"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t70",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a18d"
     },
     "text": "Choco + VoiceOrder Solutions"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t71",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a19e"
     },
     "text": "Choco on its own"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t72",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1be"
     },
     "text": "Kitchens order by speaking into an app"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t73",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "89a5813a-10f6-6ba1-6eed-d733971a550a"
     },
     "text": "Tap to order in their app"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t74",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1c8"
     },
     "text": "AI storefront with personal recommendations"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t75",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1d5"
     },
     "text": "The person ordering checks each line before it sends"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t76",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1e2"
     },
     "text": "Voicemails, texts and photos of notes turned into orders"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t77",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1ec"
     },
     "text": "Sales hub plus CRM"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t78",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1f6"
     },
     "text": "Each account has its own list, at your prices"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t79",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a210"
     },
     "text": "Order number and time stamped on arrival"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t80",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a21a"
     },
     "text": "Orders come in after your office closes"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t81",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a224"
     },
     "text": "Orders reach the system you already run"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t82",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "30f8c397-6bf9-f190-2eb1-183dc2b44d9e"
     },
     "text": "FAQ"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t83",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf956"
     },
     "text": "Better than Choco, or better beside it?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t84",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "8bf0eb84-6a8d-dd56-6a0e-8116d9416d3d"
     },
     "text": "Do I need a Choco alternative to get voice ordering?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t85",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf967"
     },
     "text": "No. You can keep Choco exactly as it is and add VoiceOrder Solutions next to it. Accounts keen to talk get our app; the ones happy in Choco's app stay put. Nothing has to be switched off first, and nothing in Choco has to change."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t86",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "ad9f0390-a776-7031-a95b-984cd1988c9e"
     },
     "text": "Would that make VoiceOrder Solutions a Choco competitor?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t87",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf973"
     },
     "text": "Only in the narrow sense that both take orders. We do not run storefronts, sales tooling or a CRM, and we do not want you to give those up. Most people who search for a Choco alternative want one thing added, an order the kitchen speaks and approves, rather than a platform taken away."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t88",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "e219e293-819b-221b-6d80-7f8d2898a4d7"
     },
     "text": "Is VoiceOrder Solutions better than Choco?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t89",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf97f"
     },
     "text": "Not at what Choco is built for: bigger baskets, rep tooling and customer records. Where we are stronger is narrower. The customer approves every item before it goes, so nobody at your end interprets a message. That is why we belong beside Choco, not in its place."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t90",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "39590628-381c-9aea-6095-0746f7348939"
     },
     "text": "Does VoiceOrder Solutions connect to Choco?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t91",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf98b"
     },
     "text": "No. The two are separate products, and each vendor supports only its own. Each one sends its orders into your system on its own, ours in the formats shown above, so they reach your desk in a form it already handles."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t92",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "0f73d180-08e9-596f-f264-a95de40f9593"
     },
     "text": "Won't some kitchens end up with two ordering apps?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t93",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "7e541655-5a68-8f96-1273-8249a5c759bd"
     },
     "text": "Only if you set it up that way, and mostly you should not. Leave the accounts that like Choco's app where they are and offer ours to the ones still on the phone. Calls keep coming to your desk as they do today, just without an order number from us, because only what is sent through our app gets one."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t94",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "d9956fbb-a3d6-4b04-b3ab-98b6f5ae509f"
     },
     "text": "How soon can our accounts start?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t95",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "4446ea80-4c7a-f2a8-f0de-0a222818c94f"
     },
     "text": "Most distributors are up and running within 24 to 48 hours, and most of their customers place a first order that same day. There is no IT project, and Choco carries on as normal throughout, so there is no cut-over date to plan around."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t96",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "93ba65b0-4eb0-c64e-d0c0-933cd7a92b1d"
     },
     "text": "What does adding VoiceOrder Solutions cost?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t97",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf997"
     },
     "text": "We quote each distributor separately and list no prices. Choco's own pricing page says it charges a monthly fee based on usage and asks you to talk to sales. Since you would be keeping Choco, the useful question is what the voice step adds on top, and a quote answers it."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t98",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "7ec95cf1-65b0-b7be-b209-990427524516"
     },
     "text": "Where do the Choco details on this page come from?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t99",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a56a6caad0812b5c2cd",
      "element": "7ec95cf1-65b0-b7be-b209-99042752451e"
     },
     "text": "Choco's own site, read on 10 October 2026: the module names and descriptions off the homepage and the usage-based line off their pricing page. We have not repeated the growth figures they publish, because those are their numbers and not ours to vouch for. If any of it has moved on since, this page is what needs correcting."
    }
   }
  ]
 ],
